    "text_full": "Thursday, May 21, 2026\nTRENDING\nMouni Roy Brings Desi Royalty to Cannes 2026 in a Stunning Gujarati Patola Gown, See Pics‘Khatron Ke Khiladi 15’ Contestants Fees: Who Is Likely the Highest Paid Contestant on Rohit Shetty’s Show?Seema Singh’s Cannes 2026 Appearance With Son Shrey Singh Is All About Grace, Glamour and Indian CultureAfter ‘Mortal Kombat II’, Get ‘Mortal Kombat 3’ Update: From Storyline to Cast, All You Need to Know'Dragon' Star Jr NTR Birthday: 5 Iconic Performances That Proved He is Tollywood’s True ‘Young Tiger’‘Off Campus’ Season 2 Release Date Announced? Everything To Know About the Returning Briar University SeriesJr NTR’s ‘Dragon’ Cast, Release Date and Plot Details: An Assassin, a Cop and a Deadly Showdown Await'India's Got Latent 2' Guest Rumours: Alia Bhatt, Sharvari on Samay Raina's Show? Leaked Image Goes ViralDaily Horoscope for May 20, 2026: What Today's Astrological Predictions Reveal for Scorpio, Aquarius, Aries and MoreJr NTR's Movie ‘Dragon’ Release Date: Prashanth Neel’s High-Octane Action Spectacle Unveils Powerful First GlimpseJacqueline Fernandez Turns Heads at Cannes 2026 Chopard Miracles Gala in Elegant Vintage-Inspired Black DressPreity Zinta’s Movie ‘Vibe’ Release Date: Actor Returns To Big Screen With Kunal Kemmu’s Action-Comedy After Long HiatusBox Office Collection Report (19 May 2026): ‘Karuppu’, ‘Pati Patni Aur Woh Do’, ‘Raja Shivaji’ And More, Which Film Is Winning The Audience?Planning a Summer Trip? Visit These 5 Beautiful Spots Near Mumbai for a Cool Summer Escape‘Cocktail 2’ Cast Names With Photos: Shahid Kapoor, Kriti Sanon And Rashmika Mandanna Lead This Stylish Romantic Drama\nEntertainment\nTV\nOTT\nMusic\nGlobal\nSports\nBollywood\nSouth\nHome\nEntertainment\nBollywood\nBox Office Collection Update (14 May 2026): How Are ‘Daadi Ki Shaadi’, ‘The Devil Wears Prada 2’, ‘Michael’ And Others Performing At The Box Office?\nBox Office Collection Update (14 May 2026): How Are ‘Daadi Ki Shaadi’, ‘The Devil Wears Prada 2’, ‘Michael’ And Others Performing At The Box Office?\n‘Bhooth Bangla’ continues its strong box office run while ‘Raja Shivaji’ and ‘Michael’ maintain stable collections at cinemas. Here’s a detailed look at the latest BO collection update featuring ‘Daadi Ki Shaadi’, ‘The Devil Wears Prada 2’ and other theatrical releases.\nRishika SinghMay 15, 2026, 11:53 IST\n\nIt was a mixed Thursday at the box office, with some films holding steady and others feeling the mid-week dip. From a desi comedy about a grandmother's viral post to Akshay Kumar's supernatural outing crossing the Rs 248 crore mark globally, there is plenty to unpack from yesterday's numbers.\n\nThe week belongs to Bhooth Bangla in terms of sheer pull, but Raja Shivaji continues to perform well in its second week and Michael is quietly ticking along in its third. Here is a full breakdown of how each film fared on May 14.\n\n‘Daadi Ki Shaadi’ Box Office Collection Day 7\n\nThe family comedy starring a spirited grandmother whose accidental Facebook post sets off a chain of chaos collected Rs 0.44 crore net on Day 7 from 1,405 shows. Total net collections stand at Rs 5.34 crore.\n\n‘Raja Shivaji’ Box Office Collection Day 14\n\nRiteish Deshmukh's passion project continues to draw crowds in its second week. The historical action drama, which Deshmukh also directed, traces the rise of young Shivaji Bhosale and his vision of Hindavi Swarajya. Day 14 brought in Rs 1.90 crore net from 3,836 shows, with the total net collections now at Rs 76.95 crore.\n\n‘The Devil Wears Prada 2’ Box Office Collection Day 14\n\nThe long-awaited sequel, set in the world of Runway Magazine two decades after the original, collected Rs 0.54 crore net on Day 14 from 826 shows. Total net collections in India are at Rs 25.44 crore.\n\n‘Michael’ Box Office Collection Day 21\n\nThe Michael Jackson biopic is in its third week and still finding audiences. Covering Jackson's journey from the Jackson 5 era to his early solo years, the film collected Rs 0.95 crore net on Day 21 across 1,301 shows. Total net collections stand at Rs 56 crore.\n\n‘Bhooth Bangla’ Box Office Collection Day 28\n\nAkshay Kumar's horror comedy Bhooth Bangla remains the clear frontrunner at the box office. Directed by Priyadarshan, the film follows a man who inherits a haunted palace in Mangalpur and uncovers its dark secrets while planning his sister's wedding there. On Day 28, it collected Rs 1.25 crore net in India across 4,061 shows, taking its total net to Rs 164.30 crore. With overseas collections of Rs 53.30 crore gross, the worldwide total now stands at Rs 248.12 crore.\n\nThe box office this week paints an interesting picture of audience taste. Bhooth Bangla is well on its way to becoming one of the bigger hits of 2026, while Raja Shivaji is proving that historical content still connects strongly with Indian audiences. The weeks ahead will be telling for the smaller releases still finding their footing.\n\nTRENDING\n\nMouni Roy Brings Desi Royalty to Cannes 2026 in a Stunning Gujarati Patola Gown, See Pics\n\n‘Khatron Ke Khiladi 15’ Contestants Fees: Who Is Likely the Highest Paid Contestant on Rohit Shetty’s Show?\n\nSeema Singh’s Cannes 2026 Appearance With Son Shrey Singh Is All About Grace, Glamour and Indian Culture\n\nAfter ‘Mortal Kombat II’, Get ‘Mortal Kombat 3’ Update: From Storyline to Cast, All You Need to Know\n\n'Dragon' Star Jr NTR Birthday: 5 Iconic Performances That Proved He is Tollywood’s True ‘Young Tiger’\n\n‘Off Campus’ Season 2 Release Date Announced? Everything To Know About the Returning Briar University Series\n\nJr NTR’s ‘Dragon’ Cast, Release Date and Plot Details: An Assassin, a Cop and a Deadly Showdown Await\n\n'India's Got Latent 2' Guest Rumours: Alia Bhatt, Sharvari on Samay Raina's Show? Leaked Image Goes Viral\n\nDaily Horoscope for May 20, 2026: What Today's Astrological Predictions Reveal for Scorpio, Aquarius, Aries and More\n\nJr NTR's Movie ‘Dragon’ Release Date: Prashanth Neel’s High-Octane Action Spectacle Unveils Powerful First Glimpse\n\nJacqueline Fernandez Turns Heads at Cannes 2026 Chopard Miracles Gala in Elegant Vintage-Inspired Black Dress\n\nPreity Zinta’s Movie ‘Vibe’ Release Date: Actor Returns To Big Screen With Kunal Kemmu’s Action-Comedy After Long Hiatus\n\nBox Office Collection Report (19 May 2026): ‘Karuppu’, ‘Pati Patni Aur Woh Do’, ‘Raja Shivaji’ And More, Which Film Is Winning The Audience?\n\nPlanning a Summer Trip? Visit These 5 Beautiful Spots Near Mumbai for a Cool Summer Escape\n\n‘Cocktail 2’ Cast Names With Photos: Shahid Kapoor, Kriti Sanon And Rashmika Mandanna Lead This Stylish Romantic Drama\n\nRelated Articles\nSalman Khan News Today: Why the Bollywood Superstar Is Trending All Over Social Media!\nPreity Zinta’s Movie ‘Vibe’ Release Date: Actor Returns To Big Screen With Kunal Kemmu’s Action-Comedy After Long Hiatus\nBox Office Collection Report (19 May 2026): ‘Karuppu’, ‘Pati Patni Aur Woh Do’, ‘Raja Shivaji’ And More, Which Film Is Winning The Audience?\n‘Main Vaapas Aaunga’ Release Date Announced: Diljit Dosanjh, Vedang Raina And Sharvari Bring Imtiaz Ali’s Love Story To The Big Screen\nTerms of use Privacy Policy\nCopyright © 2026 Bennett, Coleman & Co. Ltd. All rights reserved."
